---
title: "Application Pipeline State Machine"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New: Market Intel<br/>finds match

    New --> Saved: Coordinator<br/>shortlists for prep
    New --> Rejected: Coordinator<br/>rejects (low fit)

    Saved --> Applied: Nick approves ✅<br/>App Tracker logs
    Saved --> Rejected: Nick rejects ❌

    Applied --> Interviewing: Interview<br/>confirmed
    Applied --> Rejected: Application<br/>unsuccessful
    Applied --> Withdrawn: Nick<br/>withdraws

    Interviewing --> Offered: Offer<br/>received 🎉
    Interviewing --> Rejected: Not<br/>progressed

    Offered --> [*]: Nick handles<br/>directly
    Rejected --> [*]
    Withdrawn --> [*]

    note right of New
        🔍 Market Intel Agent
        Scans and scores opportunities
    end note

    note right of Saved
        📝 Agent-side workflow states
        (materials_prep, awaiting_approval)
        tracked in filesystem, not DB
    end note

    note right of Saved
        🛑 Human Approval Gate
        Nick must approve in Slack
        before status moves to Applied
    end note

    note right of Applied
        📊 App Tracker Agent
        Owns tracking from here
        Follow-ups: Day 7, 14, 21
    end note

    note right of Interviewing
        🎤 Interview Prep Agent
        Triggered automatically
    end note

    note right of Offered
        👤 Nick handles directly
        Agents provide data only
    end note
